%!PS-Adobe-3.0
% A scene file: gallery/evening_lake.ps as a dictionary of settings. The
% driver (scenes/scene.ps) loads this before the library; a `-D` option
% still wins over any of it.
<<
    /Presets [ /Evening /Clear /Alpine ]    % time of day, weather, terrain
    /Seed 5  /AA true
    /Pitch 2  /Yaw -27  /HFov 55
    /TerrOX 180  /TerrOZ 400  /CamAbove 5
    /WaterRise 1.4                          % the lake
    /WaterCol [ 0.10 0.15 0.16 ]
>> fc-settings
